n\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory with model class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\\)</span> (model-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\\)</span> (existential formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2024ee60951aa39e\" href=\"?note=2024ee60951aa39e\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments\">17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> (formulas in displayed variables, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (parameter satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\bar a]\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\bar a]\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model completeness gives elimination down to existential formulas, not full quantifier elimination and not an untyped “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\exists\">\\(\\forall\\exists\\)</span>-formula class.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"2024ee60951aa39e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fra